### 1. Register second tenant (test3)
POST https://localhost:7111/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass1!"
}

### 2. Login as tenant A (test@example.com) - copy this token as TOKEN_A
POST https://localhost:7111/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass1!"
}

### 3. Login as tenant B (test3@example.com) - copy this token as TOKEN_B
POST https://localhost:7111/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass1!"
}

